{"id":"cbddf9eabf158853","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-levy-khintchine.md","title":"Lévy–Khintchine Formula","display":"thm-levy-khintchine — Lévy–Khintchine Formula","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-levy-khintchine","aliases":["58-thm-levy-khintchine"],"display":"thm-levy-khintchine — Lévy–Khintchine Formula","depends_on":["[[58-df-levy-process]]","[[58-df-characteristic-function]]","[[../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-levy-khintchine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-levy-khintchine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levy-khintchine — Lévy–Khintchine Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"58-df-levy-process\">58-df-levy-process</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"084076b1e347ab30\" href=\"?note=084076b1e347ab30\" title=\"58-df-characteristic-function\">58-df-characteristic-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e36ff0da02f94e7a\" href=\"?note=e36ff0da02f94e7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md\">../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"58-df-levy-process\">58-df-levy-process</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e36ff0da02f94e7a\" href=\"?note=e36ff0da02f94e7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md\">../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}khintchine} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\to\\exists!\\langle a,\\sigma,\\nu\\rangle\\;\\left(a\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in[0,\\infty)\\land\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S(\\nu,1)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[e^{iuX_t}]=\\exp\\!\\left(t\\left(iau-\\frac12\\sigma^2u^2+\\int_{\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}}(e^{iux}-1-iux\\mathbf1_{\\lvert x\\rvert&lt;1})\\,\\nu(dx)\\right)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}khintchine} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\to\\exists!\\langle a,\\sigma,\\nu\\rangle\\;\\left(a\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in[0,\\infty)\\land\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S(\\nu,1)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[e^{iuX_t}]=\\exp\\!\\left(t\\left(iau-\\frac12\\sigma^2u^2+\\int_{\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}}(e^{iux}-1-iux\\mathbf1_{\\lvert x\\rvert&lt;1})\\,\\nu(dx)\\right)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>With the displayed truncation function fixed, the Lévy triplet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,\\sigma^2,\\nu)\">\\((a,\\sigma^2,\\nu)\\)</span> is unique.</li>\n<li>The formula determines every one-dimensional marginal and hence the law of the Lévy process.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-levy-process","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-levy-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-characteristic-function","status":"resolved","id":"084076b1e347ab30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-characteristic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md","status":"resolved","id":"e36ff0da02f94e7a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-levy-process","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5$ is the predicate from [[58-df-levy-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md","status":"resolved","id":"e36ff0da02f94e7a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2$ is the predicate from [[../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}khintchine} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\to\\exists!\\langle a,\\sigma,\\nu\\rangle\\;\\left(a\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in[0,\\infty)\\land\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S(\\nu,1)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[e^{iuX_t}]=\\exp\\!\\left(t\\left(iau-\\frac12\\sigma^2u^2+\\int_{\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}}(e^{iux}-1-iux\\mathbf1_{\\lvert x\\rvert<1})\\,\\nu(dx)\\right)\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"(a,\\sigma^2,\\nu)","display":false}],"bytes":1329,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4286","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-levy-khintchine.md|58-thm-levy-khintchine]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d0a20d5f74408674","084076b1e347ab30","e36ff0da02f94e7a"]}